Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.15,0:00:02.90,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)}Quando in Scozia trovi traffico.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Signora mucca, per cortesia...\Nci lascia passare?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.93,0:00:11.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Non si sposta finché non ha\Nla sua mela, amico!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.23,0:00:13.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}...Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.86,0:00:18.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Dice che si sposta solo per una mela!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.46,0:00:20.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Ce l'ho io!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.99,0:00:30.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A quanto pare Morag viene con noi.
